      "writtenOn": "2024-08-09T18:03:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think there are no major blockers. `prebuilt_apis` already creates the versioned sdk `java_import` modules, and we also have a `java_import` module for the prebuilt [core-lambda-stubs](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/prebuilts/sdk/+/404da75a812b647f0c155c02a07c9347af3b3fdb:tools/Android.bp;l\u003d98;drc\u003df8da54c288e69b3533373d43a5c98588c5be5d18;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d0). I did not move it to `decodeSdkDep` since it will affect builds, and I would like to do some additional testing.\n\nWould you prefer that we do this cleanup now instead of this hack?",
      "parentUuid": "da03b3d5_f48a4628",
      "revId": "6e8bd1cc371f9e37ab81ed7ed3f3f4e129e476d4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2377577e_dbb39737",
        "filename": "java/base.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 2234,
      "author": {
        "id": 1962375
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-08-09T18:24:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Would you prefer that we do this cleanup now instead of this hack?\n\nI\u0027m not quite sure. Could the existence of [this module](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:prebuilts/sdk/Android.bp?q\u003dname:%5Cs%5C%22sdk_.*_.*_android) disturb this logic?",
      "parentUuid": "1b94e8b9_6732766a",
      "revId": "6e8bd1cc371f9e37ab81ed7ed3f3f4e129e476d4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "05f8148c_5159e2d3",
        "filename": "java/base.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 2234,
      "author": {
        "id": 1878380
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-08-09T18:36:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That filegroup is interesting. It clashes with the name of the `java_import` module created by `prebuilt_apis`. So we have two modules here\n1. `sdk_public_30_android` (a filegroup)\n2. `prebuilt_sdk_public_30_android` (a java_import, notice the `prebuilt_` prefix)\n\n\u003e Could the existence of this module disturb this logic\n\nFor clarification, are you referring to the logic here or after the cleanup of b/358608607?",
      "parentUuid": "2377577e_dbb39737",
      "revId": "6e8bd1cc371f9e37ab81ed7ed3f3f4e129e476d4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9b2f6e0f_39a13452",
        "filename": "java/base.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 2234,
      "author": {
        "id": 1962375
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-08-09T18:41:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was initially referring to the logic here, but I think that it might affect the cleanup as well. i.e. could there be a mismatch between the jar path in `sdkDep` and the module that we are appending to `compileDepNames`? Or should we append the `prebuilt_*` to the compile dep names instead?",
      "parentUuid": "05f8148c_5159e2d3",
      "revId": "6e8bd1cc371f9e37ab81ed7ed3f3f4e129e476d4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "079b8014_0a2fc074",
        "filename": "java/base.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 2234,
      "author": {
        "id": 1878380
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-08-09T18:50:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the logic here:\nI believe the current implementation should be fine, albeit somewhat fortuitous because of these two combining together:\n1. The filegroup is not written to `module_bp_java_deps.json`, since it does not implement `IDEInfo`\n2. `prebuilt_` [prefix is trimmed](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/java/jdeps.go;l\u003d64;bpv\u003d1) from the name when writing to the json file. So the name of the java_import module does not contain the prefix.\n\nFor the cleanup:\nI think you are right, it will affect the cleanup. My preliminary thoughts are that it will be easier to rename the filegroup to something else and update its rdeps.",
      "parentUuid": "9b2f6e0f_39a13452",
      "revId": "6e8bd1cc371f9e37ab81ed7ed3f3f4e129e476d4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
